## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- BB 1σ upper: `iBands(NULL, PERIOD_M15, 20, 1.0, 0, PRICE_CLOSE, MODE_UPPER, i)`
- BB 1σ lower: `iBands(NULL, PERIOD_M15, 20, 1.0, 0, PRICE_CLOSE, MODE_LOWER, i)`
- BB 2σ upper: `iBands(NULL, PERIOD_M15, 20, 2.0, 0, PRICE_CLOSE, MODE_UPPER, i)`
- BB 2σ lower: `iBands(NULL, PERIOD_M15, 20, 2.0, 0, PRICE_CLOSE, MODE_LOWER, i)`
- Trend-UP zone: `Close[i] > bb1_upper[i] && Close[i] < bb2_upper[i]`
- Trend-DOWN zone: `Close[i] < bb1_lower[i] && Close[i] > bb2_lower[i]`
- LONG entry: `in_trend_up[1] && in_trend_up[2]` → buy at bar[0] open
- LONG exit: `Close[0] < bb1_upper[0]` (back in neutral)
- Implement both variants (trend-follow and buy-at-value) as sub-strategies; P2 tests both
- P3 sweeps: BB period (15/20/25), variant (trend-follow only / buy-at-value only / both), consecutive bars (1/2/3), exit (neutral zone / SMA20 cross)

## Related strategies
- Related: QM5_11374 (kathy-lien-xtreme-fade-bb3sigma-adx-m15) — same author, same BB basis, different extreme threshold (3σ vs 2σ)
- Differentiator: Double BB uses zone membership rather than extreme touch; catches more trades but earlier in the move; 1σ/2σ vs 2σ/3σ is the key parameter difference

